      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR MYSTERY BET (3) continued a run of placings when third and just 1.2 metres from the winner at Kilmore last week. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Deserves another win and could achieve it here. AUSSIE JAY MAC NZ (11) is going well, winning here two back before breaking but recovering to place last time. Has won a trial since. Tricky draw but has the ability with manners and even luck. TOBYS SHOUT (1) has been thereabouts of late, adding to a series of top-four results with a good effort last time out for third at Echuca. Chance to break through. KRISSY (8) found winning form last week at Charlton and draws for a trail so can make an impact again. OVER THE LINE (10) put the writing on the wall when runner-up two back before landing a third-up win last week at Charlton. Tougher draw but she is race fit so could go on with it.",
